# Blue Ward's "blue" is a color word of its text (CR 612.1, 702.16): Bot1's Sleight of Mind changes it to red, so the
# Devoted Hero it enchants has protection from red and no longer from blue (CR 612.2), and the Aura, white, stays. Bot2
# then cannot target the Hero with Lightning Bolt (the refusal; the bolt aimed at Bot1 is the positive control).

